wf-withdrawal-stage-1 = You can't stop thinking about { $family }.
wf-withdrawal-stage-2 = Your hands won't keep still. You need { $family }, badly.
wf-withdrawal-stage-3 = Everything aches. Without { $family } you're falling apart.
wf-withdrawal-relief = The craving lets go of you.
wf-withdrawal-satisfied = That's the { $family } you needed. You feel like yourself again.

wf-withdrawal-craving-stimulant-1 = Just one line would sharpen everything up.
wf-withdrawal-craving-stimulant-2 = You feel slow, heavy, dull.
wf-withdrawal-craving-stimulant-3 = You catch yourself grinding your teeth.
wf-withdrawal-craving-opioid-1 = Your skin crawls.
wf-withdrawal-craving-opioid-2 = You'd give anything to feel warm again.
wf-withdrawal-craving-opioid-3 = A cold sweat breaks out over you.
wf-withdrawal-craving-psychedelic-1 = The world looks flat and grey.
wf-withdrawal-craving-psychedelic-2 = You miss the colours.
wf-withdrawal-craving-psychedelic-3 = Everything feels too ordinary.
wf-withdrawal-craving-empathogen-1 = You feel very alone.
wf-withdrawal-craving-empathogen-2 = Nobody here really likes you.
wf-withdrawal-craving-empathogen-3 = A dull sadness settles over you.
wf-withdrawal-craving-cannabinoid-1 = You can't settle.
wf-withdrawal-craving-cannabinoid-2 = Everything is irritating today.
wf-withdrawal-craving-cannabinoid-3 = You'd sleep better after a smoke.
wf-withdrawal-craving-combat-1 = Your heart feels sluggish without the edge.
wf-withdrawal-craving-combat-2 = You feel slow and soft.
wf-withdrawal-craving-combat-3 = You want that rush back.
wf-withdrawal-craving-nicotine-1 = You could really use a smoke.
wf-withdrawal-craving-nicotine-2 = Your fingers itch for a cigarette.
wf-withdrawal-craving-nicotine-3 = You feel on edge.

